  "baseline_commit": "e340c96",
  "scope": "Native C++/Python RgbContrastSessionEditor.set_saved_selection explicitly replaces historical selection/whole-plane policy after complete metadata/resource admission. Mapping/components, visit positions, other stages, source capture and live draft remain unchanged. Frozen geometry is validated even when whole-plane mode ignores it; invalid coordinates, addresses, draft access, policy types and record-budget excess retain the entire prior command without source reads. Shared C++/Python ImGui Use current selection and Use whole plane actions take exact visit/stage/policy fields, preserve live selection/navigation, invalidate only private preview and retain complete session Apply/recording/history. Whole-plane policy keeps the previously frozen selection metadata; current-selection policy captures the current source selection at the historical stage plane. One hundred twenty-six new installed cases cover seven components, three geometry choices, whole-plane modes, current/earlier visits, invalid ignored masks, strict types, budget refusal and complete paired publication with literal region bytes. Windows/Linux each pass 6345 installed Python checks, six native groups including real clicks on both area buttons, an installed public C++ SDK consumer and three standalone UI probes, zero failure/error/skip. SDK checks exact masked and whole-plane pixels through the installed header/core. The initial budget-test cap of 65536 refused even the unchanged starting command; corrected to 262144 so setup is admitted but the large replacement is still refused, with unchanged product and numerical/atomic expectations; failing reports and source variant remain. Final source/product/header identities are checked before sealing. Actual disposable venv interpreters import installed modules; Python performs no product processing. Temporary environments, failed/final pytest scratch, native fixture trees and SDK intermediates are CRC/every-member-SHA archived before exact confined removal; final installs/native carriers/SDK examples/probes/reports/logs remain. No dependency or historical acceptance record change. All99 original scope/status triples and the old Auto fingerprint failure remain unchanged. Cross-visit movement, arbitrary visit authoring, broad real canvas/navigation/Auto/Reset input and complete ImageJ/Fiji/platform/resource acceptance remain open.",
